{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Free Demo for Keep the Balance!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo includes the first part of the game. You'll learn the core mechanics, face your first challenges, and experience the unique <strong>struggle for balance</strong> firsthand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ONE WHEEL. ZERO MERCY.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Keep the Balance&quot; is a balancing act that looks simple but is nearly impossible to master. You're not just controlling a character; you're learning a new limb\u2014one that's clumsy, difficult, but full of potential. Every inch of progress is a victory, and every fall is an unforgettable memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just a game. It's a test of patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/extras/3f8e5bf2451c24573253a2afde2eb6e8.poster.avif?t=1758647321\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/extras/3f8e5bf2451c24573253a2afde2eb6e8.webm?t=1758647321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/extras/3f8e5bf2451c24573253a2afde2eb6e8.mp4?t=1758647321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE CONTROLS ARE SIMPLE, THE STRUGGLE IS REAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no complex combos or skill trees here. It's just you, your unicycle, and the unforgiving laws of physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/extras/0e0ad91b5b82fdddbe7329ef50697a87.poster.avif?t=1758647321\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/extras/0e0ad91b5b82fdddbe7329ef50697a87.webm?t=1758647321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/extras/0e0ad91b5b82fdddbe7329ef50697a87.mp4?t=1758647321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLDS TO MASTER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey. Every world is filled with new and devilish obstacles designed to test your balancing skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/extras/1da5ea8873bfd7824af300a435144a1e.poster.avif?t=1758647321\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/extras/1da5ea8873bfd7824af300a435144a1e.webm?t=1758647321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/extras/1da5ea8873bfd7824af300a435144a1e.mp4?t=1758647321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IF YOU ENJOY A GOOD RAGE-QUIT, YOU'RE IN THE RIGHT PLACE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Keep the Balance&quot; offers you a new challenge. Challenge yourself, stream your attempts, and let your friends laugh with you (or at you)!</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043340?t=1758647321","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043340?t=1758647321","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/0c63dec97467a9bfb12346ba4e51be5e56b16cf1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758647321","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/0c63dec97467a9bfb12346ba4e51be5e56b16cf1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758647321","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Free Demo for Keep the Balance!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo includes the first part of the game. You'll learn the core mechanics, face your first challenges, and experience the unique <strong>struggle for balance</strong> firsthand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ONE WHEEL. ZERO MERCY.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Keep the Balance&quot; is a balancing act that looks simple but is nearly impossible to master. You're not just controlling a character; you're learning a new limb\u2014one that's clumsy, difficult, but full of potential. Every inch of progress is a victory, and every fall is an unforgettable memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just a game. It's a test of patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/extras/3f8e5bf2451c24573253a2afde2eb6e8.poster.avif?t=1758647321\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/extras/3f8e5bf2451c24573253a2afde2eb6e8.webm?t=1758647321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/extras/3f8e5bf2451c24573253a2afde2eb6e8.mp4?t=1758647321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE CONTROLS ARE SIMPLE, THE STRUGGLE IS REAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no complex combos or skill trees here. It's just you, your unicycle, and the unforgiving laws of physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/extras/0e0ad91b5b82fdddbe7329ef50697a87.poster.avif?t=1758647321\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/extras/0e0ad91b5b82fdddbe7329ef50697a87.webm?t=1758647321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/extras/0e0ad91b5b82fdddbe7329ef50697a87.mp4?t=1758647321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLDS TO MASTER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey. Every world is filled with new and devilish obstacles designed to test your balancing skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/extras/1da5ea8873bfd7824af300a435144a1e.poster.avif?t=1758647321\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/extras/1da5ea8873bfd7824af300a435144a1e.webm?t=1758647321\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/extras/1da5ea8873bfd7824af300a435144a1e.mp4?t=1758647321\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IF YOU ENJOY A GOOD RAGE-QUIT, YOU'RE IN THE RIGHT PLACE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Keep the Balance&quot; offers you a new challenge. Challenge yourself, stream your attempts, and let your friends laugh with you (or at you)!</p>","developers":["Overload Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3732570","name":"Keep the Balance"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043340/d59652417647defc9fdd175834c8ca5cc07bbf25/header.jpg?t=1758647321","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4043340/1157707498/ffa5d3f28d5ae6117cb02845147c54ab869eb136/1758182248/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758557667","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4043340/1157707498/ffa5d3f28d5ae6117cb02845147c54ab869eb136/1758182248/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758557667","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4043340/1157707498/ffa5d3f28d5ae6117cb02845147c54ab869eb136/1758182248/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758557667","id":257200902,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200902/movie480.mp4?t=1758557667","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200902/movie_max.mp4?t=1758557667"},"name":"Game Overview","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257200902/277d8e3102fc8c55588ddd3f668f2f3878a599f7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758557667","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200902/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758557667","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257200902/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1758557667"}}],"name":"Keep the Balance Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><s